# DevOps Change Safety

## Environment promotion

All changes — infrastructure and application deploys — must progress **sb → dev → tst → prod**. No skipping steps, even for simple fixes. Confirm environment before running any deploy workflow or manual promotion.

## Ask first (high blast radius)

Loop in the principal engineer before:

| Area | Why |
|------|-----|
| Production deploys | Real customers |
| Shared networking or DNS | Many dependents |
| IAM / OIDC / Cognito | Security blast radius |
| WAF / public load balancer rules | Edge exposure |
| Remote state or backends | Can break every stack |
| `terraform destroy` / `force_destroy` | Irreversible |

## Secrets

No secrets in workflow files, commit messages, or logs. App config at runtime comes from SSM via `container_secrets`. GitHub Secrets only when SSM is not viable.

## When unsure

Stop and ask. Slow and correct beats fast and on fire.
